[{"title":"发渐岭","author":"吴与弼","text":"寸心无怨亦无尤，何处栖身不自由。\n焉有閒情牵琐琐，逡巡学德是吾忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10563,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊周家渡","author":"吴与弼","text":"朔风微雨月朦胧，周渡相将夜落篷。\n内省秪应随遇好，前程不必计穷通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10564,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"吴与弼","text":"客梦醒时宵向分，欲将行止共谁论。\n黄流亵味君休问，只管吾心存不存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10565,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"红叶连村归兴浓，黄柑带雨更玲珑。\n倚篷小立苍茫外，诗在云烟杳霭中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10566,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重宿下窑寺","author":"吴与弼","text":"入院閒吟对雨时，梦醒贪看月流辉。\n驱驰倦客西归晚，不待鸡鸣急早炊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10567,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旴江谢郡侯遣钟抡潘玉来习乡射礼二生归裁此以赠之","author":"吴与弼","text":"弥月龙潭讲礼回，从容行李不须催。\n黄堂风采超今古，何处闾阎不看来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10568,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陈崇书教谕考绩赴天官","author":"吴与弼","text":"芸阁兰灯利断金，骊驹朝唱白头吟。\n恩波阔处多鱼雁，细写岁寒松柏心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10569,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日次杜韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"翼翼趋朝候鼓催，共瞻小往大应来。\n新功煅炼当思奋，夙志骁腾孰肯灰。\n欲见天心时访柳，閒窥物理独寻梅。\n平生几案惟书册，谈笑何曾到酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10570,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓枕作","author":"吴与弼","text":"黄卷新功日又加，愈知圣道浩无涯。\n长更宁忍贪高枕，争奈昏昏两眼花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10571,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜枕作","author":"吴与弼","text":"一德蹉跎不易成，空怜两鬓久星星。\n雪窗欹枕无眠夜，谁共新功观我生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10572,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜晚眺","author":"吴与弼","text":"宝镜团团挂碧霄，翠屏隐隐隔平桥。\n回头更会梅边境，缓步微吟击壤谣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10573,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"又出柴关踏雪晴，养心随处抱遗经。\n含英咀实尝闻命，莫向尘寰枉此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10574,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜枕作","author":"吴与弼","text":"脚板何曾梦孔颜，百川东逝可西还。\n须当痛惜桑榆日，莫把光阴当等閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10575,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"勇","author":"吴与弼","text":"驱山塞海未是勇，借问如何学日新。\n敛收不可敛之气，伏枥安流勇乃贞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10576,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿西廨彭氏 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"诗成频听曙鸡声，却喜灵台一点明。\n须识宴安真鸩毒，足知忧患乃吾生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10577,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿西廨彭氏 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"平生雅志在希颜，岁晚工夫始识难。\n但保寸心长似铁，何妨万水与千山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10578,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次桂家林","author":"吴与弼","text":"系䌫沙头朋盍簪，新吟兼唱旧时吟。\n怀开不觉笑谈久，总是平生铁石心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10579,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"责躬","author":"吴与弼","text":"中岁知非已过时，老来空赋责躬诗。\n一生总被虚名误，千虑难逃实德疵。\n无计可回前日月，有功终作后男儿。\n战兢尽此桑榆力，卫武朝朝是我师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10580,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重宿太平寺","author":"吴与弼","text":"琴书欣有托，故旧念重逢。\n踪迹炎凉异，心期礼乐同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10581,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜独坐","author":"吴与弼","text":"夜半残灯坐不眠，孤吟霜月小寒天。\n昏昏病眼时无恙，又托精诚向简编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10582,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独坐","author":"吴与弼","text":"寻得幽偏养性灵，衰年惟喜少逢迎。\n简编随意閒舒卷，尽日禅房一味清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10583,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省躬","author":"吴与弼","text":"一身衰谢浑无赖，万事蹉跎总不能。\n何以激昂偷惰气，博文约礼是馀生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10584,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观语类为政以德章感程子而作","author":"吴与弼","text":"尤人只见无虚日，罪已何曾有实功。\n莫把寸心矜立雪，但专一味暮春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10585,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜晴","author":"吴与弼","text":"偶来知己话忘疲，拨尽寒炉别去迟。\n开户忽惊晴送喜，旋添雪水写新诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10586,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"雪满园林风满轩，圣贤对语夜忘眠。\n新知滋味私欣处，何幸苍苍假我年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10587,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿朱坊","author":"吴与弼","text":"华颠客子已还家，夜读扁舟灯又花。\n料得馀生无别喜，圣经贤传是生涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10588,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿沙河","author":"吴与弼","text":"梦回试省有何思，只念因循学过时。\n几向平常犹易失，志当造次愈难持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10589,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次桂家林夜宿江岸傅氏","author":"吴与弼","text":"已喜琴书达桂林，却愁风雨打寒衾。\n漫移栖息投安处，又称青灯夜读心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10590,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次桂林渡宿江岸吴氏","author":"吴与弼","text":"苍山古渡认松林，寓宿江皋舍馆深。\n少长肃雍挥翰罢，银灯花映读书心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10591,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次小陂头登陆","author":"吴与弼","text":"寒冲暝色小陂头，烈火黄柑礼数优。\n归去摩挲青玉案，独惭铁画与银钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10592,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓枕作","author":"吴与弼","text":"义利须明判两途，斩钉截铁是嘉谟。\n不于生死路头悟，何以能为大丈夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10593,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜枕作","author":"吴与弼","text":"四檐风雪夜漫漫，今古兴怀事几般。\n数口幸然无冻馁，群生宁免少饥寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10594,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜枕作","author":"吴与弼","text":"失便宜是得便宜，倚伏循环不必疑。\n俯仰但令无愧怍，前程一听老天为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10595,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺彭九彰落成新居","author":"吴与弼","text":"穆卜高居谐吉兆，翚飞华栋恊清朝。\n三阳交处天心泰，百福臻时瑞气饶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10596,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读易绝句","author":"吴与弼","text":"消息盈虚万不齐，等閒谁识此心微。\n春窗灯火无言处，刚悔因仍学易迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10597,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病后作","author":"吴与弼","text":"老来日月信无多，拟向春风咏太和。\n局促尘窗淫雨里，一年桃李病中过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10598,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起游园","author":"吴与弼","text":"并游无侣又春风，况复兼旬百病攻。\n幸有馀芳晴烂熳，微吟缓步太平中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10599,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"黄州桥畔阁澄澄，近水遥山映晚晴。\n高枕自知行李倦，清风明月是平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10600,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"晓牧清溪课二雏，从来养正在于初。\n咏归虚阁閒眠处，又喜新知叶圣谟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10601,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"浴罢归来月满林，又从虚阁学澄心。\n万缘有命宜随遇，不用逢人话陆沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10602,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寝起","author":"吴与弼","text":"寝息将兴日射窗，又凭吟几纳微凉。\n乾坤阔达身心寂，信是閒中兴绪长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10603,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"吴与弼","text":"无事时来自得亭，秋风淅淅昼阴清。\n寻常在世无他技，精白于天是此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10604,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辰孙诞日","author":"吴与弼","text":"凤阁归来岁二更，庚辰之载汝才生。\n又逢初度裁新什，祝尔诗书与日增。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10605,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宁寿同日同时生","author":"吴与弼","text":"辰孙既有新诗律，宁寿那无善祝规。\n流俗浮情休借问，先民遗范是依归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10606,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"灌罢时蔬又坐亭，游鱼泼泼沼澄澄。\n天光云影徘徊处，谁共当年一鉴情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10607,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧自得亭","author":"吴与弼","text":"养病时来沼上眠，托身物外自悠然。\n区区为幸诚多也，随处先师有格言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10608,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓枕","author":"吴与弼","text":"万事悠悠东逝波，秋风摇落兴如何。\n晓窗寂历无言处，独唱苍松翠柏歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10609,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈佥宪挽章","author":"吴与弼","text":"绛帐当年交有道，青衿遗爱感无穷。\n门生故吏今重见，谁共摩挲慨古风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10610,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与豫章吴生沼上亭子话旧","author":"吴与弼","text":"两地关心久别情，相招亭子话平生。\n青藜缓步归来好，细咏新诗对短檠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10611,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓枕作","author":"吴与弼","text":"危者平兮易者倾，圣谟宜敬不宜轻。\n独怜暮景无多了，笃实新功敢暂停。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10612,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"数日桂花香","author":"吴与弼","text":"丹桂秋香又一年，老怀不必思华颠。\n闻香随处堪乘兴，浮世升沉一听天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10613,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沼上芙蓉花开","author":"吴与弼","text":"玩易亭中归去迟，芙蓉忽喜映清池。\n流年自换人依旧，为已工夫日百之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10614,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次己卯岁芙蓉花诗韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"忽惊花吐兴无涯，认取平安是我家。\n万事不须閒着意，只应随分阅年华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10615,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"万缘由命不须愁，晚节蹉跎是我忧。\n羲画周文同坐卧，夕阳西去水东流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10616,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"富贵无心生有涯，朝昏务去是矜誇。\n高眠玩易微吟处，又对芙蓉满眼花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10617,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玩月","author":"吴与弼","text":"万事无端不系情，读书终日掩柴扃。\n金风动地顽云散，四望青霄霁月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10618,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"候饶循","author":"吴与弼","text":"暝倚虚庭玩偶奇，纷纷凉月满絺衣。\n悠然真意无言表，忽报阶前客子归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10619,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与吴贞游东陂石泉","author":"吴与弼","text":"初冬天气已严霜，霁色家家穫稻忙。\n红树题诗归步缓，不知何处是仙乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10620,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和田园乐","author":"吴与弼","text":"冰泮雪消舜日，含哺鼓腹尧天。\n南亩万蓑春雨，东皋千井朝烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10621,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"隆孙诞日","author":"吴与弼","text":"人生须作好男儿，德业从来贵及时。\n虚度光阴真可惜，几时能听老夫诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10622,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"霜叶烧残更寂历，寒灰拨尽独沉吟。\n细看隐隐云留象，默感生生造化心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10623,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜读感怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"为圣为贤当日事，流风馀韵后人思。\n残䰟何以酬初志，允出名言兹在兹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10624,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阁夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"金鸡已报霜天曙，芸阁重歌紫陌吟。\n百岁光阴浑似梦，十年身世若为心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10625,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"化日曈曈照曙筵，儒衣秩秩拜钧天。\n杖藜碧涧谈经罢，梅柳迎春又一年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10626,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同诸孙出村观雪景","author":"吴与弼","text":"尘窗黄卷日埋头，时唤诸孙度雪桥。\n极目长村云渐薄，几多寒馁望青霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10627,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"墙角溪头日日来，境幽偏称病中怀。\n简编随处微吟罢，时探梅花次第开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10628,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜怀恪一辈为求籴旴江","author":"吴与弼","text":"风急天寒念远游，唱筹何日问归舟。\n四方幸喜多青眼，观主宜人不必忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10629,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓窗偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"希贤希圣事何如，顽钝之资费琢磨。\n素服前言焉敢惰，但怜来日苦无多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10630,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜怀坚二","author":"吴与弼","text":"独怜游子未归时，夜半无眠有所思。\n稚子弱妻风雪里，孤村心事梦依依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10631,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题玉湾李大章午风亭","author":"吴与弼","text":"贱迹何劳纪，名园自足扬。\n午风新气象，乔木旧辉光。\n德义声猷远，诗书兴绪长。\n经过时有赋，题向郑公乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10632,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春感怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"日日潜心向伏羲，晓窗高咏立春时。\n梅花满树方惊眼，又对千红万紫时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10633,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟呈赵刘二侯","author":"吴与弼","text":"衡茅衰卧正呻吟，枉沐旌麾欲降临。\n稍待条风向明媚，远从花坞候车音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10634,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"剑山酆氏淑景亭","author":"吴与弼","text":"新碣峨峨结架雄，支流虽异本原同。\n载瞻载仰翚飞表，春在乾坤浩荡中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10635,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓝头书屋为新喻何琛题","author":"吴与弼","text":"新种芸香屋数椽，青山绿水映华颠。\n欲知自下升高处，人十能之已必千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10636,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓枕作 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"满眼梅花看未饱，朱樱处处又舒红。\n一年好景休孤负，细认洋洋发育功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10637,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓枕作 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"两眼昏花日抱疴，书程全减睡魔多。\n春深何处无颜色，李白桃红奈若何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10638,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"一春多病倦游嬉，又对莺啼燕语时。\n疏竹短墙流水曲，众芳深处咏归迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10639,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坐东门外樟树根","author":"吴与弼","text":"脉脉春流一涧盘，新晴锦绣万花攒。\n小诗留与儿孙诵，老大曾于此考槃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10640,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自得亭即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"一亭潇洒隔纷嚣，坐卧于斯兴自饶。\n雨后落红殷满地，崇桃相对尚妖娆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10641,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自得亭对雨书怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"刚恨平生学圣难，馀龄程课肯容悭。\n洛闽幸有阶梯在，精白斯心日夜攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10642,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]